tes:\n* If I could have a version of the image with no background, that would be ideal\n\nPlease feel free to add in your own ideas however you'd like if you feel inspired! You can make Taiyou as cocky or pretty or cool as you'd like. \nYou can also make changes to his outfit or hair if you'd like to.\n\nThank you for your consideration (❁´◡`❁)\n\nhttps://twitter.com/_tai__you_/status/1631715542770884624", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@maimaiga/works/21", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4ee571b3/uploads/origins/b11c665f-9b73-4760-b63f-dd3eaa6c0ec1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed520ea2b45efddab797e508d333d44b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4ee571b3/uploads/origins/b11c665f-9b73-4760-b63f-dd3eaa6c0ec1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed520ea2b45efddab797e508d333d44b, https://si.imgix.net/4ee571b3/uploads/origins/b11c665f-9b73-4760-b63f-dd3eaa6c0ec1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=414e3b61956294488c981495679e8746 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4ee571b3/uploads/origins/b11c665f-9b73-4760-b63f-dd3eaa6c0ec1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f3e92f570770324a7b615ffe5460d947 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、私のキャラクター「キキ」の絵を描きます。\n\nこれらは彼女の参考資料です：\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/7waphl.png\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/ntyzlr.png\n\n彼女がかわいく見えるようなポーズなら何でもできます。\n彼女は甘くて、無邪気で、とても恥ずかしがり屋です。\n\nありがとうございました！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@maimaiga/works/20", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/70dacf64/uploads/origins/5fbc2926-cda9-4459-b464-703335ade193?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd6728ea7166cef85e07a07cf77cee79", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/70dacf64/uploads/origins/5fbc2926-cda9-4459-